sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (OBS/FFmpeg)
    participant P as Proxy (NGINX-RTMP)
    participant S as on_publish_start.sh
    participant A as Controller API (FastAPI)
    participant W as RTMP Worker (nginx-rtmp)
    participant F as FFmpeg Process (no Proxy)
    participant Y as YouTube RTMP

    Note over C,P: INÍCIO DA STREAM

    C->>P: RTMP connect/publish<br/>rtmp://proxy/live/streamX
    P->>P: Accept handshake<br/>application live

    P->>S: exec_publish /scripts/on_publish_start.sh streamX

    Note over S,A: Alocação de worker

    S->>A: HTTP GET /allocate?stream=streamX
    alt Worker já alocado para streamX
        A-->>S: { pod: worker-abc..., status: "existing" }
    else Nenhum worker disponível
        A->>A: list pods app=worker (Ready & idle)
        alt Há worker Ready & idle
            A-->>S: { pod: worker-xyz..., status: "allocated" }
        else Nenhum worker Ready
            A->>A: read deployment scale +1 replicas
            A-->>S: { pod: null, status: "scaling" }
            loop Até 60s (timeout)
                S->>A: /allocate?stream=streamX
                A-->>S: { pod: worker-xyz..., status: "allocated" }(quando subir)
            end
        end
    end

    S->>S: armazenar WORKER_DNS

    Note over S,F: Iniciar relay FFmpeg por stream

    S->>F: start ffmpeg (background)<br/>input: rtmp://127.0.0.1/live/streamX<br/>output: rtmp://WORKER_DNS/live/streamX
    S-->>P: exit 0 (exec_publish concluído)

    Note over P,F: NGINX continua recebendo pacotes<br/>FFmpeg lê da mesma app /live

    F->>W: RTMP publish /live/streamX
    W->>Y: push rtmp://mediaserver.eadmeeting.com/LiveApp/KEY

    Note over C,P: STREAM ATIVA (tempo real)

    C-->>P: RTMP disconnect (fim da live)

    P->>P: detectar fim de publicação /live/streamX
    P->>S: exec_publish_done /scripts/on_publish_done.sh streamX

    Note over S,F,A: Cleanup de recursos

    S->>F: kill ffmpeg PID para streamX
    S->>A: HTTP POST /release?stream=streamX
    A->>A: remove mapping streamX ↔ worker-xyz
    A-->>S: { status: "released" }
    S-->>P: exit 0

    Note over W,Y: Worker fica idle<br/>pronto para próxima stream
